Anteater Chess Alpha Source Release
Installation Instructions

1. Extract the source package:
   gtar xvzf Chess_Alpha_src.tar.gz

2. Change to the project directory:
   cd Chess_Alpha_src

3. Build the program:
   make

4. Run the program:
   ./bin/chess

5. Run the maintained test suite:
   make test

Recommended verification command:
- make clean all test
  Rebuild from scratch, run the tests, and leave the executable in bin/

Optional commands:
- make clean
  Remove generated build files while preserving bin/, bin/logs/, and bin/tests/
- make tar
  Regenerate Chess_Alpha_src.tar.gz

This source package is intended for a Linux environment with GNU Make
and a standard C toolchain installed.

Runtime logs are written to:
- bin/logs/

For more details, please refer to the files placed in doc/ when they are
included in the release package.
